    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # fill in your ORCID
abstract: >-
  mimic-iv-omop-pg is an end-to-end PostgreSQL implementation of the
  OHDSI/MIMIC ETL, which is officially BigQuery-only. The pipeline
  converts MIMIC-IV v2.2 to OMOP Common Data Model v5.3.1 in an
  existing OHDSI Broadsea PostgreSQL stack via a single command,
  with idempotent phases, an automated BigQuery-to-PostgreSQL SQL
  converter (bq_to_pg.py), five mechanical patches, and reuse of an
  already-loaded Athena vocabulary through views. The repository
  includes a full DataQualityDashboard validation (1,990 checks),
  clinical replication across six cohorts (sepsis, AKI by KDIGO,
  heart failure, acute MI, atrial fibrillation, type 2 diabetes),
  and comparative documentation against other community
  MIMIC-to-OMOP implementations.
